"""
## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Prove that UiPackedProducer / writer contract (design section 2.2, 2.3).
Audience: compiler and tooling engineers who maintain this spec.
"""
# @req: REQ-LIB-COMMON-001 — stable requirement identity for this spec.

# @cover src/lib/common/ui/ui_scene_slice.spl 70%
# @cover src/lib/common/ui/draw_ir_v3_ports_v2.spl 70%
# @tag: unit, ui, draw_ir, draw_ir_v3, unified_packed_ui_scene, l1

